1) First Case When you want checksum of some particular column, then use following approach, 
   value of exlude: true denotes we want to consider all column excluding mention colun in col, if exclude is not given mean false

      - checksum:
          col:
            - id
            - name
          exlude: true
          target: checksumColFor2Column1

      - checksum:
          col:
            - age
            - dept
          target: checksumColFor2Column2



1) Second Case When you want checksum of all column in row, then use following approach, 
   if value is col is not given, by default it calculate checksum for all columns in dataset,
   value of row should be false or not given is also ok, 

      - checksum:
          exlude: false
          target: checksumForCompleteRow

      - checksum:
          target: checksumForCompleteRow
